# Prisma rules — backend/prisma/**

- Apply schema changes only through Prisma migrations: `npx prisma migrate dev`.
- Never hand-edit migration files.
- After schema changes, regenerate the client with `npx prisma generate`.
- Never edit the generated client under `backend/src/generated/`.
